+
+```
+DP1 (Pte)   →  DP2 (Cpl)   →  DP3 (MCpl)   →  DP4 (Sgt)   →  DP5 (WO)
+  |               |                |                |                |
+  |  Basic       |  Core Ops      |  Advanced        |  Squad Lead   |  Senior Instructor/
+  |  Foundations |  Core Tasks    |  Malware Rev‑Eng |  Threat Hunt  |  Enterprise Architect
+  |               |                |  + IoT/OT MA    |  + OT MA      |  + Cyber Intel
+  |               |                |  + Cyber Intel  |  + Offensive  |  + Offensive Ops
